{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34297","headline":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 五泻舟 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 五泻舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"样自桐川得，词因隐地成。\n好渔翁亦喜，新白鸟还惊。\n沙际拥江沫，渡头横雨声。\n尚应嫌越相，遗祸不遗名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}